*   **torque (0.00):** The 100PS diesel produces 250Nm (approx 184 lb-ft) and the 130PS produces 300Nm (approx 221 lb-ft). The 100PS is close to the average benchmark of 190 lb-ft, while the 130PS is above. Averaging these places it around the benchmark.
