*   **cargo_space (0.90):** Offers a large cargo volume (3.3m³ for L1, 3.9m³ for L2, up to 4.4m³ with FlexCargo) and high payload (up to 1000kg), far exceeding the cargo space of an average passenger car.
*   **rear_space (-1.00):** The panel van version has no rear passenger space.
*   **ground_clearance_in (0.00):** Standard ground clearance is around 160-180mm (approx 6.3-7.1 inches), which is around the average for compact crossovers.
*   **turn_radius_ft (0.10):** Turning circles (11.0m L1, 11.8m L2) are reasonable for a vehicle of this size, slightly better than the average sedan benchmark when converted (approx 36-39 ft).
